<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Telecasters Nqld     15.38    5.20</p>
<p> 2   Hills Inds	     13.98    1.86</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	11.89    1.03</p>
<p> 4   Mt Leyshon Gold	10.68    2.34</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.74    0.77</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.68    0.94</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   9.60    1.70</p>
