<p> 9   Prop Income Inv	 9.41    1.08</p>
<p>10   Spotless Svc	    9.40    1.17</p>
<p>11   Centro Prop	     8.94    2.18</p>
<p>12   Colonial Mutual	 8.62    1.20</p>
<p>13   Gandel Retail Tr	8.57    0.91</p>
<p>14   Colonial Coml	   8.27    2.23</p>
